// FiveM ASI build declaration.
//
// FiveM's asi-five loader maps each .asi with LOAD_LIBRARY_AS_DATAFILE and looks
// for an FX_ASI_BUILD resource whose TYPE id is the running game build. Without
// a matching entry it refuses to load the plugin at all and says so on screen.
//
// Every build FiveM offers is listed, DELIBERATELY, even though the game
// signatures in src/game/signatures.h are only derived for current builds. The
// choice is between two failure modes on an old build:
//
//   not declared - FiveM refuses the plugin and shows an error, which reads to
//                  a user as "the mod is broken / won't launch"
//   declared     - the plugin loads, game::resolve() finds nothing, and it stays
//                  dormant. Nothing happens, quietly.
//
// The second is the better failure. game::resolve() succeeds or fails as a unit
// and nothing installs unless every signature resolved, so a build we cannot
// pattern costs a log line, not a crash - which is what makes declaring builds
// we have not verified safe to do here.
//
// Verified: 3889 (GTA5.exe 1.0.3889.0), all 23 Legacy signatures resolving.
// Everything else is declared for graceful degradation, not tested.
//
// Listing a build FiveM does not offer is harmless - it is simply never matched
// - so this is the union of FiveM's own build list and the set other ASIs ship.
// This resource is only ever read by FiveM; it is inert in a normal game.
FX_ASI_BUILD 1604 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 2060 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 2189 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 2372 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 2545 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 2612 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 2628 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 2699 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 2802 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 2944 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 3095 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 3258 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 3323 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 3407 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 3442 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 3504 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 3521 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 3570 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 3586 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 3717 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 3751 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 3788 BEGIN "\0" END
FX_ASI_BUILD 3889 BEGIN "\0" END
